            <div xml:id="d1137">

                <pb facs="0944" n="828" xml:id="pg828"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.001H87/13.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Note.</hi>—Many protests were made to the President
                    and to the Secretary of State by Mexican consular and military officers of both
                    the Conventionist and the Constitutionalist factions against the landing of
                    General Huerta, most of them adding a request for his detention, in some
                    instances with the further request that he be delivered to Mexican authorities
                    for trial.</p>
            </div>
